<title>MEXICO: John Deere Mexico asks to delist shares.</title>
<headline>John Deere Mexico asks to delist shares.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-02-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares listed by John Deere's Mexico unit will be delisted as of Monday at the company's request, the Mexican Stock Exchange said on Monday.</p>
<p>John Deere de Mexico is a subsidiary of U.S.-based Deere &amp; Co.</p>
<p>The BMV added that the delisting was approved by the National Banking and Securities Commission on February 6.</p>
<p>((--Mexico City newsroom +525 728 9552))</p>
